OL,3,GNEWSASunderland priest gives Pope Leo
OL,4,Afootball jersey
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Sunderland AFC chaplain has given
OL,7,FPope Leo a football jersey ahead of the
OL,8,Fclub's return to the Europa League.
OL,10,FFather Marc Lyden-Smith, who has
OL,11,Ftravelled to the Vatican with other
OL,12,Fpilgrims from the north-east of
OL,13,FEngland, presented the pontiff with the
OL,14,Fcustom red and white strip which had
OL,15,F"Pope Leo, 14" emblazoned on the back.
OL,17,FIn 2013, Lyden-Smith also gave Pope
OL,18,FFrancis a shirt, saying: "He took it
OL,19,Fand we were playing Newcastle a few
OL,20,Fdays later and we won."
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
