OL,3,GNEWSASunderland priest gives Pope Leo
OL,4,Afootball jersey
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Pope Leo did say that he would be
OL,7,Fpraying for the team as they started
OL,8,Ftheir European campaign so let's see
OL,9,Fwhat happens," he said.
